&lt;p&gt;    @zjffdu I&apos;ve received this issue report from one of my colleagues that he ran a wrong code to read all of the data from a large directory and it took for 20mins with a spark job and he tried to stop a spark interpreter. and Then he tried to create a new note, but he couldn&apos;t see an interpreter lists from creating note page and a list-interpreter when clicking a button on a note.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    BUT I&apos;ve tried to make it with current master into my local but it fails because &apos;restart&apos; always work fine. It looks only until 0.7.3.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Generally, this code doesn&apos;t a problem anymore in current master and branch-0.8, but this kind of synchronized blocks don&apos;t look good. I prefer to change it but it&apos;s not a bug now. What do you think of it?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
